[patient] it's just been really stiff and painful. and, uh, after i work, it's really hard for me to flex and extend my left elbow.
[doctor] okay. and, uh, have you noticed any swelling?
[patient] yes, i have noticed swelling on the olecranon of my elbow.
[doctor] okay. and, uh, are you right-handed?
[patient] yes, i am right-handed.
[doctor] okay. and, uh, are you still able to write with your right hand?
[patient] yes, i can still write, which is great.
