 encourage you to check and record your blood sugars every day. i'm going to increase your metformin to 1000 milligrams twice a day. it's very important that you take your medication on a regular basis twice a day. i'm also going to order a hemoglobin a1c test for a more accurate assessment of your long-term blood sugar levels. and i'm also going to refer you to diabetic counseling for more information on the steps you can take to manage your diabetes. for your hypertension, you're currently controlled with medication and exercise, so i'm going to continue you on lisinopril 10 milligrams. i also encourage you to continue with your walking routine. so, all your questions were answered. do you have any other questions for me?
