dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hey, how are you?
[patient] i'm doing well, how are you?
[doctor] i'm doing well. so, i know that you had a heart attack a little while ago. how are you doing?
[patient] i'm doing well, yeah, i'm doing well. i'm a little bit worried about my blood pressure, but otherwise, i'm doing well.
[doctor] okay. well, let's talk about your blood pressure first. so, you know, i did review your last blood pressure reading, and it was a little bit higher than i'd like to see, but it's not out of control. i do think that we need to continue to monitor that. but, let's talk about your heart. so, your heart was damaged in that heart attack, and we're going to need to get you back into the gym to get your heart back into shape. so, i'm going to send you to cardiac rehab, and i think that's going to be really helpful for you. are you comfortable with that?
[patient] yes, i'm comfortable with that.
[doctor] okay. and then, i do think that we should also get you into a nutritionist, because i know that you're not eating the best diet. and, i think that that will really help you, you know, get back into a better diet.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] so, i'm going to order that, and we'll get you into the nutritionist, and then we'll get you started on the cardiac rehab. and then, in terms of your blood pressure, i'm going to continue you on the lisinopril, and we're going to add a medication called aldactone, and i'm also going to prescribe lasix, so that we can get your swelling down.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and then, in terms of your heart, i'm going to continue you on your brilinta, and we'll continue to monitor you, and we'll do another echo in a couple of months to see how your heart is doing. and then, in terms of your diabetes, i'm just going to continue you on your metformin. i'm going to check your blood sugar in a little while, and then we'll go from there. any questions?
[patient] no, that sounds good.
[doctor] okay. all right, so, i'm just going to go ahead and order those medications, and we'll get you set up with the nutritionist and the cardiac rehab. and then, we'll follow up in a couple of months. okay?
[patient] okay.
[doctor] all right, i'll see you in a couple of months.
[patient] okay. }}<|eot_id|>
