[patient] okay. and then, um, um, how much does it cost?
[doctor] um, i'm gon na give you a prescription, and you can go to the pharmacy, and you can pick it up, and they'll give you the price. um, if you have insurance, it'll probably be covered, but if you don't have insurance, it'll probably be around 50 dollars.
[patient] okay. okay. thank you so much.
[doctor] okay. you're welcome. }}<|eot_id|>
