Patient: Hi. 
Doctor: Hi. How are you today? 
Patient: Good. Good. 
Doctor: Good. Um, so, uh, can you, can you tell me a little bit about what brings you in today? 
Patient: Um, so I'm, I'm having an annual check-up for my asthma, and I'm also having an annual check-up for my allergies, and I'm also having an annual check-up for my food allergy. 
Doctor: OK. OK. And, uh, so, uh, um, so, uh, how have you been feeling? Uh, have you been having any symptoms, uh, recently? 
