dialogue is: {{ Doctor: Hello, Sophia. Hi. Good morning. Hi. 

Patient: Hi. Hi. Hi. Hi.

Doctor: Hello. Hello. Hi. So, um, so you've got a bit of a problem with your knees, is that correct?

