Patient: Um, yeah. It's been about six months now. I've been having a lot of pain in my knees. Um, it's been getting worse over time. And I've been trying to kind of, you know, just deal with it on my own. But I've been having a lot of trouble.

Doctor: Okay. So, so six months ago, you started having pain in your knees. And you've been having pain in both knees, is that right?

